WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.950
Compare the three source snapshots.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:07.165
CV32A60X has one issue port; CV32A65X enables two.

3
00:00:07.165 --> 00:00:13.486
Both are 32-bit configurations without an MMU or supervisor and user modes.

4
00:00:13.486 --> 00:00:23.601
The selected 64-bit example enables those facilities, plus atomic and floating-point extensions, but has one issue port.

5
00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:27.562
A family name does not determine every feature.

6
00:00:27.562 --> 00:00:33.547
These are concrete parameter packages, not an exhaustive product table.

7
00:00:33.547 --> 00:00:39.700
Select each configuration and follow its source link to check the values.

